### Recuperar todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/example

### Recuperar un usuario por id (path to regex)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/example/0272b164-789b-4806-90fe-34fef29b0f1f

### Crear un usuario
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/example
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Hal Finney",
  "jobArea": "Cypherpunk",
  "email": "Hal-Finney@yahoo.com",
  "isBlock": true
}

### Actualizar parcialmente a un usuario
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/api/v1/example/1855f050-4efa-4e3c-8355-1fbaa1595669
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "David Chaum",
  "jobArea": "Cypherpunk's Father",
  "email": "David-Chaum@yahoo.com"
}

### Eliminar un usuario por id
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/api/v1/example/0272b164-789b-4806-90fe-34fef29b0f1f
